start dates, career outcomes Positions Available Home About Us Positions available Join the Australian Institute of Business Australia’s largest online MBA provider*, the Australian Institute of Business (AIB) , is a registered higher education provider offering a range of high quality tertiary programs including the AIB MBA . With almost 40 years of history, we are one of the most established private education institutions in Australia. We were Australia’s first private provider accredited to offer the full range of business degrees, including Master of Business Administration (MBA), Doctor of Business Administration (DBA) and the prestigious Doctor of Philosophy (PhD). *see 20 Biggest Online MBA Providers, MBA News (July 2024) AIB is made up of a diverse, driven and achievement-oriented group of people inspirited by our five key values: Be student focused Be bold Be accountable Be curious Be you Working at AIB is a truly fulfilling and rewarding experience, as we work to make a real difference in the lives of our students. Our staff have the great privilege of being able to celebrate with the AIB community at graduations and other events and see firsthand how an MBA has transformed not only their careers but their lives. AIB has a strong focus on research and learning, and we are committed to enabling the continuing development of our staff to expand their knowledge and skills. Development opportunities include conferences, training programs, and formal study, including undertaking an MBA while working at AIB at a discounted rate. We believe that a healthy work-life balance is key to productivity, creativity, and most importantly the wellbeing of our staff so we offer flexible work arrangements to suit individual needs. We are also committed to achieving equal opportunity and diversity in the workforce, and to providing a safe and inclusive work environment. As the world continues to change rapidly, the demand for online education has never been greater. Applying for a job with AIB presents a unique opportunity to be part of a team that is leading the way in redefining postgraduate business education. Current positions Online Facilitator applications can be sent to olf-recruitment@aib.edu.au Expand All Email: enquiries@aib.edu.au Email: courseadvisorca@aib.edu.au Phone: +61 8 8212 8111 Phone: +1 888 2427044 Refer a friend Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Follow us on Youtube Follow us on Linkedin Contact Blog Privacy & Legals Policies & Procedures Home (AU) Home (CA) Enquire FAQ Privacy & Legals Policies & Procedures ABN 86009115422 Institute of Higher Education PRV12090 It looks like you're in Canada... Go to Canada Site Dismiss"
